    "turn_text": "Are the ships operational, though, because the Navy is looking at saving some like $3.6 billion over five years by retiring them. Number one, are they the right class of ships for Mayport, ultimately? And if not, then what may ultimately be? Representative Rutherford talked about the anti-submarine role.",
