  {
    "episode_id": 92415,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/2/92415.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 9,
    "turn_text": "Well, Joe Biden caused the problem. If you look at when Joe Biden got elected, gas prices were significantly lower. We were pretty close to being energy independent. And what he's done is he's shut down, you know, Biden shut down the Keystone pipeline to a large job to talk to a company and forward to the other day that lost half of their employees. They built equipment for the Keystone pipeline. They lost over 300 employees as a result of that. They don't talk that their administration won't authorize a whole bunch of permits. So if you might have a lease to do something, but you have to get a federal permit to do something, and the administration has just shut down the permitting process. So we've seen a significant reduction in the production of oil and gas in our country, and that's what's causing the gas prices up. So we, if we want, if we want lower gas prices, we're going to have to safely, which we can in this country, safely produce oil and gas in this country. Instead, what the Biden administration is talking about doing is going to places that, the one that hurt us, Iran and Venezuela in particular, they, you know, they, they're horrible dictators. They're murderous dictators, they're thugs. And the Biden administration is talking to them about getting oil and gas from them rather than get it from our country where we could produce it cleanly. safely and we need to be self-sufficient. We should never, ever, ever be dependent on somebody. When you're growing up, the first thing you want to do is you want to get out of people telling you what to do. You want to be independent. The same thing as this country. This country needs to be independent, energy independent, pharmaceuticals independent. We've got to save ourselves. We got some items out here. We didn't pick them. They picked us. We can't be doing business with them. We can't be doing business with Russia. Communist China, Iran, Venezuela, they want to destroy our way of life.",
